 "Screenshot0.png", "id": "582417523527697", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031634_582417526861030_6231624501241717856_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5yyMWfWWNKMQ7kNvwFYJkim&_nc_oc=AdoktUik-Rz-DuSiF4pOIn0IRuqo_2g7IoWnOb62DuR6AJIrxRrRytU6DW6lYrr-A2w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSuTpIk9vBsnvAivtm_nZsjr34bVOEvigFcm2tKaGNgzQ&oe=6B047CA2"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot1.png", "id": "586367519626138", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003242_586367522959471_5282683893066263987_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=izDE-nIpeR8Q7kNvwHdMbug&_nc_oc=AdoBJzXcWzxjDXyIXpI6H0XnfLOb_yCfp-jvXOSwAv-KxfN3XFRJRGGJcLHACOTmAR8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQiQ_S6lCf7e735Dz8rq2s5ExTx_V0mW0q5ZWdS-WGZqQ&oe=6B046D0C"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot2.png", "id": "582630293360190", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982541_582630296693523_6117141187659797588_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_GvvQtHPO2cQ7kNvwG7Q7CD&_nc_oc=Adod60u9n1PQRHMmoSN8vDExEMSruYgGQqcIA6fRhytZH6uvnJRMLKTePvC9Bk4R7fI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTVglXzBxmcWSM7ebe2kpCKo1Z6yM--rDzftEBEZTw4fg&oe=6B048393"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "1615302805533708", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031315_1615302808867041_8474953266952880772_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w4fVKJcoWhIQ7kNvwGNQwUG&_nc_oc=Adp9JCxRfJK9HcHmNWXkYI6NVh046NN2Ux0n54vGwt_hKxW2ulQK_VsqUKGccUIwnz0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSBBZznyIPGGkkk1zDYfrq9tEWBVVlIPv2hyYmfNbpBDQ&oe=6B048751"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "782483226108424", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974593_782483229441757_2357525884853135287_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cgrGgb2OC2cQ7kNvwHeRBch&_nc_oc=AdrWNa8vcytlxffOs-susm4FEWF6ZLg2b0ggt8ZdRE1vA3t4_RbiO4o8FqNJGOrfNvI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR-ZOhcr6igMSf31qzdRWkGVySa4Y9OEerQGePHh9Uocg&oe=6B046BF2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLandscape.png", "id": "782023966478773", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974515_782023973145439_749891387670287731_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eIW6rX-3rhIQ7kNvwHjcV27&_nc_oc=AdrqWd5IACC6bIGwuTdVzVykT0k4j4yjAypvE1FHOyVuBQLtap46RlmCP2avz5EkT_o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT3NMLPcRZZxRlEM9GOMiHNOR0JwTt616wz0-bu1oBRlg&oe=6B045BEF"}, "display_name": "3D scan of a snowy town", "keywords": ["photogrammetry", "reconstruction", "360camera", "digitization", "scan"], "long_description": "Move like a pedestrian in a snowy town, reconstructed from videos taken by a helmet-held 360 camera, whose trajectory is about 670m long.\n\nRight controller:\n- Rotate on the left or right by using the joystick\n- Update the vertical offset (up or down) by using the joystick\n- Choose a location and teleport to it by using the virtual laser pointer\n- Teleport by using the index trigger only if the laser is green (not red)\n\nLeft controller:\n- Move continuously by using the joystick\n- Switch pannel and map by using the grip/hand trigger\n- If both map and pannel are disabled, switch between rendering modes (texturing or normal colors) by pressing the index trigger\n- The map shows the cloud of mesh vertices and the user location\n- If the pannel is enabled, switch between constrained and unconstrained motions by pressing the index trigger\n- The constrained motion controls your height above the ground\n- The pannel shows information about the 3D model and the selected motion.", "short_description": "Move continuously like a pedestrian in a snowy town, which was computed by photogrammetry from two 2496x2496 videos taken by a helmet-held camera (Garmin Virb 360) and by walking about 670 meters in a town (Laschamps, in France)."}]}, "developer_name": "Maxime Lhuillier", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unity 2019.4", "support_website_url": "http://maxime.lhuillier.free.fr/", "website_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EXPLORATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8618312318218961"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974901_393927342871345_7472813470315400161_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LP2tkUPvDKUQ7kNvwGt1FuV&_nc_oc=AdpMQ4JOauyPRMEVKDokswFKUGQYshs-ieU4OwGYfi375mlnuYWcZ77U-P5t7zT0L0A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTjvFmzkGJK7esTjub5FDXGwfcaRwLW4oAuggZLJYYm7A&oe=6B047F4C"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "3D scan of a snowy town", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Travel & Exploration", "id": "726368587961803"}], "release_date": 16607